{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_04_end","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-4","storyName":"百物语","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"森内、萌萌香和“神明”意识到御机的怪谈绝大多数其实都是三船的设计，感到强烈的幻灭。但他们还来不及想接下来的事，三船派出的忍者就杀了过来，掳走了森内。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["森内","萌萌香","星熊","好事的神明","沉默的忍者","偷袭的忍者","伺机的忍者"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_64_g11_odenstall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_electricbicycle_speedup","volume":"0.6","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":12},{"type":"charslot","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"星熊小姐，还有萌萌香？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"先吃点东西垫垫肚子？还是说我拜托二位的事情这么快就有结果了？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"吃、吃东西就不必了……一路骑到这里，我觉得自己喝了好多风……","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"金石会的人还在追你们？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"多亏神明大人点拨，再加上我们特意挑了人迹罕至的路线，回来的路还算顺畅。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#8$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"神明大人……难道说？！","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"别高兴太早。虽然的确是神明大人，可并不是你要找的那位。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"……没关系，没关系！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_monocycle_bell","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"真没关系？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#8$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"您、您是……？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"看，我就说嘛。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#8$1","id":40},{"type":"multiline","name":"森内","text":"不，不不！小店没什么能招待您的，您看要不要……来点关东煮汤暖暖身子——","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#13$1","id":42},{"type":"multiline","name":"森内","text":"不对，所有的关东煮随您挑！","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我可不像某些家伙，对你做的关东煮那么上心。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"神明大人，不知您——","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"不知什么？不知我有没有见过你口中的招财猫，对不对？你要找的根本就不是我，而是他。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"不敢！能见到一位神明，对我来说已经是天大的喜事，我哪敢挑挑拣拣？","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"可你的眼睛分明就不是这么说的。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"以前我和那家伙还能聊得上天的时候，他口中的你可没这么做作。你那时就是个小孩子，小孩子怎么对朋友，你就怎么对他。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#4$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"……祂就是因为这个离我而去的吗？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我哪知道。他记得你，但你也不过是他打过交道的无数人中的一个。他才不会费心告诉我为什么“离你而去”。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#9$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"这……","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我来找你有别的理由。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"没问题！您想从我这儿得到什么？金钱？还是信息？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_formal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":66,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"当然是信息。有关怪谈的信息。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"你以为御机的怪谈都是我们这样的神明做的，但我可以明确告诉你，基本上全都不是。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#8$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"您不正是怪谈“轮入道”的本体吗？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我不否认自己每天骑着独轮车风风火火地在街上跑，可除此之外呢？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#2$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"都厅街的那个警察署背后的旧楼。“不存在的电梯”。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"只有十五层的楼里居然有显示十六层的按钮，多出来的一层便是“地狱”，那里发生过失踪事件。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"而且前台的招财猫摆件和十六层出现的时机息息相关。那个固定在台面上的招财猫偶尔会消失，第二天又重新出现在台面上。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"这样的事情不仅发生在那栋旧楼，还有很多人都跟我说过类似的事情，“招财猫饰品莫名其妙丢失又出现”之类的。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"具体到那栋旧楼，每次“误入地狱”事件发生的时候，招财猫的摆件都不见了。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"你知道得倒是细，可我偏偏能够断定，那栋楼的招财猫摆件和你想找的“神明”，除了长得像之外半点关系都没有。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"您的证据呢？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我哪需要证据？我就是神明，分辨一样东西和神明有没有关系，那还不轻而易举？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#6$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"这只能算空口无凭——","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"你刚才那股恭顺劲儿呢？","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#9$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"我……","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我可不是要责难你。像现在这样有什么说什么，比刚才那副样子好多了。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"再说，我也是仔仔细细探查过那栋旧楼的。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"第一，那根本就不是什么隐藏按钮。十六层的按钮是嵌在十五层按钮上边的，被钢板挡住了。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"那肯定不是神明做的，你们人类也不可能掀动那东西。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"十六层的按钮一直都在那里……只是被钢板挡住了？！","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"森内的脸色忽然变得有些难看。","id":100},{"type":"charslot","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"看，你也觉得自己有点傻了，是不是？","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"第二，那个招财猫是能按动的。使劲按，按下去，能把整个摆件按到台面下面去。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"您……按了？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"按了啊，按了也什么都没发生。前台回来的时候随便鼓捣鼓捣，那个摆件就又冒出来了。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"然后那个前台就开始接电话，接了一长串，一直在道歉什么的。就这样。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"看，你不过是把真正的怪谈和那个前台的怪癖联系在了一起而已。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#9$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"那……怎么可能是怪癖呢？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"那还能是什么？把招财猫摆件压到台面里去，难道是他和你正相反，跟那家伙有什么仇怨？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那个……","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"小姑娘？怎么了，你去那做过节目？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"没有，但之前综艺节目取材的时候，一个同事曾经提过这个点子，然后被事务所所长骂了一顿。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"骂了一顿？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"所长说了很多我不是很能听懂的话，说是里面有个“铁火场”是金石会的产业什么的。大概是饭店，怕做节目影响生意吧。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"铁火场？","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#8$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"铁火场？！","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"是啊，怎么了？“铁火”是一种鳞兽料理的名字，那铁火场不就是卖铁火的饭店吗？","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……“铁火场”是赌场的暗语。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"看来“地狱”不过是金石会的赌场，有人误入那里后被封口了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"十六层的按钮得通过某种机关调出来，多半对应了某个夹层，或者地下室也说不定。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那个招财猫摆件大概是发信装置，按下去就会发信，所以“神明大人”按了之后才会有人打电话，那个前台才会道歉。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香感叹了一声，不知是替森内惋惜，还是得知怪谈并非超自然力量后松了口气。","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"好事的神明略微有些烦躁地用爪子搔了搔小脑袋，显然没料到怪谈竟然如此收场。","id":139},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"而森内的脸色越来越青，越来越青，直到汗水都从他的额头上流了下来。","id":141},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":142,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"这一定只是巧合……只是巧合。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#5$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"这么多年了，也有怪谈被证明是以讹传讹的，但总有那么多怪谈没有人能解释！十六层的地狱只是个巧合！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"还有“尚存于世的福井家食堂”，我以前和那位神明大人还有来往的时候，祂曾经告诉过我，祂挺喜欢那家店的。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"前两年那家店被拆以后，时不时有人说附近能闻到炸物的香气，还有人说，那块空地上有时还能看见店面，只是不能走近——","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"那里被拆了之后一直都是空地啊。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那家店我有印象。当时我想去探店，店主不让我进，我就去了另一家。那期节目播出后没多久，店就没了。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那几天到处都在传，说是我诅咒了店家，要不就是“怪谈女王又发力了”，还有“这不就是报复，这人简直睚眦必报”之类的话……","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"那店就是金石会拆的啊。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#5$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"我当然知道！但我们说的是拆掉之后的事！萌萌香，那家店拆掉以后，你们节目组不是还去过一次吗？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"是、是的，可……那次我也就只闻见了炸物的香气，其实没看到店面……","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"想让人闻到某种香气简直再简单不过了。假如完全不考虑怪谈，这件事不就是金石会想要强拆福井家食堂吗？","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"先给人留下一个这里可能发生怪谈的印象，然后强拆，最后再派萌萌香去一次。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"那……那……青鬼的……凶宅！","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……森内老板，你要在我面前聊这个？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#6$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"抱歉冒犯，但那间凶宅的人既然不是你所害，那就仍然有可能是神明！","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"就连这位神明大人，不也是在凶宅的怪谈传开之后才开始追逐怪谈的吗？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"这倒的确。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#6$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"萌萌香，你最近不还去那间凶宅做过节目？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#19$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"啊哈……啊哈哈……虽然我不是被幽灵吓到，是被星熊吓到就是了。我当时还抓起地上的东西想打她——","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"“别忘了，满屋子的垃圾，她偏偏捡起了那把断刀，当时我们怎么找都找不到，只能草草伪造了一把的断刀。”","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"“就算她是无心的，事情的性质也已经变了。”","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"萌萌香？","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"不，不不不……","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"嘴上说着否定的话，但萌萌香仍然颤抖着手，从怀中掏出了那柄断刀。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"星熊，这、这只是一把断刀，对不对？三船先生不会因为这东西就要灭我的口的，对不对？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"断刀？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我拍节目那天在你家捡到的，昨晚半夜我家电视出故障的时候，我好像听见三船先生说，说因为我捡了这把刀……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"看这个刀镡，这不是佐野口那把家传宝刀吗？他当年很喜欢对其他人炫耀来着。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#8$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"佐野口？凶宅的第二个受害者，用家传宝刀砍死自己妻子然后自尽的人？","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#11$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"可是不止一个警察告诉我，他的刀已经在警察的证物室里锁着了，怎么会在你家老宅里放着？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"一定是三船先生贪图这把刀，交了假的证物上去对不对？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那这把刀怎么不在他的收藏里，反而放在我家，甚至还只剩半截？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"再说，发狂自尽这种事，黑道简直是欢迎警察来查凶手，就为了看警察什么都查不到，恨恨离去的样子……没理由伪造证物。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"除非佐野口不是自尽，是金兵卫……","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……杀了他。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":213},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香愣住了。","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"紧接着，仿佛从梦中醒来，却只是进入了另一个噩梦一样，她甚至比森内还要呆滞地看着星熊。","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"你在开玩笑，对不对？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那些怪谈……那些把我吓得要死的怪谈……怎么可能不是真的？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"事务所再怎么不像话，也不可能……这么多年一直制造……各种……各样的……","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"还有那位佐野口，只有他的……他的死……有蹊跷，而其他人……","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"她的声音越来越低，直到彻底断线。","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"她下意识地望向森内，森内却故意别开了视线。","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"她忽然意识到，自己看森内是觉得森内和自己同病相怜，而森内别开视线是因为他不愿意承认这一点。","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"……","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"所以那些被我探访过之后关闭的店……","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那些我明明按照指示做了，却还是出了错，结果有人受伤的直播……","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那些怪声、幽灵、飘忽的怪影，都是……假的？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"就连我深信不疑，这几天把我吓得魂飞魄散的青鬼和凶宅的怪谈，御机一切怪谈的起点，其实也是……假的？","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"羽生萌萌香，怪谈缠身的艺人，我的职业生涯对事务所来说……其实不重要？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"其实我在他们眼里只是一个……用来给金石会打掩护的……幌子？","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"森内老板，这肯定只是我们想多了，对不对？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#4$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"……","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.5","id":240},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"6","times":"40","duration":"0.3","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-100","duration":"0.6","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":246},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":248},{"type":"charslot","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"森内老板……？","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$prisonbreak_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_bat_prisonbreak_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":252,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"敌袭！躲到我后面！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","duration":"0.3","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"0.5","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":261},{"type":"text","text":"萌萌香仍然怔在原地，星熊跨上一步，用般若护在她和倒在地上的森内身前。","id":262},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hiddenweapon_hitshield","id":264},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":265},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_USB_explode","channel":"a","delay":"0.2","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"仿佛要给萌萌香刚才的疑问一个回答似的，盾面上传来密密麻麻的轻微爆炸声。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"神明大人，麻烦你看看森内到底怎么了，是中了毒还是被什么东西打中了？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"森内脖子上有个焦痕，旁边掉着这个东西。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"这不是你们拿来在终端间传输信息的闪盘吗？","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"之前倒是也见过有人扔这个东西瘫痪别人的电子设备，最近怎么都开始往人身上扔了？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,100","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.3","id":278},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"忍者？！","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的忍者","text":"不要抵抗。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_1917_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"谁派你来的？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的忍者","text":"这不重要。跟我走。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_1917_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"一定不是三船先生派你来的，是不是？","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的忍者","text":"……这个问题，我还是第一次听人这么问。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_1917_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"告诉我，怪谈都是真的！我的职业生涯不是三船……不是金兵卫的幌子！","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"忍者不答，只是亮出了手中似刀非刀的兵器，尽管还未刺出，却已经直指星熊前胸。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"一辈子生活在阴影中，从不以真面目招摇过市的间谍、阴谋家、纵火犯，乃至暗杀者。","id":301},{"type":"text","text":"从数百年前国战戕乱时起，这些人就开始以忍者之名活动在历史的暗面中。","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"在那之后，大名、公卿、财阀、首领……无数有权有势的人豢养过类似的组织。","id":303},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":305},{"type":"charslot","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1916_1#1$1","duration":"0.4","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"-200,0","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":310},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.3","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.2","block":"false","id":313},{"type":"playsound","key":"$sheildimpact","volume":"0.7","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","channel":"b","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"jump","posto":"500,0","power":"100","times":"1","duration":"0.6","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"60","duration":"0.4","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"偷袭的忍者","text":"呜？！","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"藏得不错，但出手太慢了。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","duration":"0.3","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"540,160","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_branchrupture","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_USB_explode","volume":"0.7","delay":"0.5","channel":"c","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"星熊一脚踩在刚刚被自己挡下的闪盘上，闪盘先是吱吱作响，然后砰的一声爆开。","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"真够与时俱进的，带高压电的闪盘。人机两用？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":342},{"type":"text","text":"两个忍者对视一眼，短刀，太刀，二人一左一右，直扑萌萌香而去。","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"死缠烂打！","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"50","randomness":"50","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","channel":"1","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","channel":"2","delay":"0.05","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing6","channel":"3","delay":"0.1","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"般若在星熊手里旋转成耀眼的圆形，太刀在外层的刃上卷得粉碎，而持短刀的忍者不得不扑倒在地，免得连手臂都在其中绞断。","id":353},{"type":"text","text":"直到这时，一直藏在阴影中的第三人才露出身形，数枚闪盘不发出一点声音，直扑星熊的后脑。","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"再出声提醒已经来不及了，于是萌萌香一跃而起，想学着电影里的样子用挎包把那些小东西打回去……","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_handknf","id":356},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"结果自己被打个正着。","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shockbody","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":362},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"0","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"细小的噼啪声响过，她连哼都没哼一声，也和森内一样落在地上，软成一团。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1916_1#1$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伺机的忍者","text":"啧！","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_npc_1916_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"萌萌香！","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1917_1#1$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的忍者","text":"只剩你一个了。要么乖乖跟我们走，要么也像他们一样倒下。结局都一样。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_npc_1917_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"自我估计过高可不是好事。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1916_1#1$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伺机的忍者","text":"……废话少说，动手。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_npc_1916_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"charslot","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.2","block":"false","id":380},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hiddenweapon_hitshield","id":381},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":382},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":383},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.4","block":"false","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hiddenweapon_hitshield","channel":"1","id":385},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hiddenweapon_hitshield","channel":"2","delay":"0.1","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hiddenweapon_hitshield","channel":"3","delay":"0.2","id":387},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":388},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"暗器从能想到的方向打来，从想不到的方向打来，却全数在舞动的般若上撞得粉碎。","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1916_1#1$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伺机的忍者","text":"她想背着两个人一起跑！截住她！","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_npc_1916_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":396},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":397},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":399},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":400},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":401},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch_xshield","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":403},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","channel":"n","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"星熊向着最近的忍者猛冲，穿着黑衣的刺客直接撞在盾面上，也不知断了几根肋骨。","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"她本打算就这么突出包围，肩上忽然一轻，森内被什么东西拖上了半空。","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"钩爪？！","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"森内还在空中，萌萌香也像抓娃娃机里的玩偶一样被钩了起来——","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_singleblunt","id":413},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wiatear_break","delay":"0.5","channel":"m","id":414},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"般若将连着钩爪的绳索切断，萌萌香落回了星熊怀中，关东煮摊老板却被惯性扔在了自己摊子前面。","id":416},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":417},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","channel":"z","id":418},{"type":"text","text":"不知哪个忍者抓起老板一跃而起，消失在仁田街的楼群之间。","id":419},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":421},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":422,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"星、星熊……","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你醒得很快。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我脖子好痛……","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"应该是被电流烧的。好好护理，应该不会留疤。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"锻冶町的方向似乎还有伏兵，你有别的地方可以给我们暂时避一避吗？","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"……我家。但金兵卫多半已经派人去过了……","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"没关系。灯下黑，他们未必能猜到我们会去那里。再说，就算真有人在，我们换个地方就是。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"那太好了，这样我还可以带上叶助……","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"叶助？","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"算了，有时间再解释。越拖人就越多。你家在哪个方向？我们这就过去。","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"神明大人，你——","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……已经不见了啊。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":448},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":449},{"type":"image","id":450},{"type":"charslot","id":451}],"characters":["森内","萌萌香","星熊","好事的神明","沉默的忍者","偷袭的忍者","伺机的忍者"]}